{
  "title": "ParticleRenderMode",
  "description": "Turns a particle system's SoA storage into drawable vertex data. A mode owns the whole \"how\": the vertex layout, the shader pair, the draw model, and the loop that fills the buffer. The backend renderers only upload what it produces and issue the draw it declares, so a new primitive is a new mode rather than a renderer change. Implementations are fixed at system construction (see `ParticleSystemOptions.render`) and default to `QuadParticles`.",
